                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "For, lo, thine enemies make a tumult: and they that hate thee have lifted up the head.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "They have taken crafty counsel against thy people, and consulted against thy hidden ones.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "They have said, Come, and let us cut them off from being a nation; that the name of Israel may be no more in remembrance.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 36,
            "text": "Ps. 74:8; Jer. 11:19."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 56
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 74:8; Jer. 11:19.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 74:8; Jeremiah 11:19",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 74,
                    "end": 74,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 8,
                        "end": 8
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "jeremiah",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 11,
                    "end": 11,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 19,
                        "end": 19
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "For they have consulted together with one consent: they are confederate against thee:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "The tabernacles of Edom, and the Ishmaelites; of Moab, and the Hagarenes;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "HEB tents."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Gebal, and Ammon, and Amalek; the Philistines with the inhabitants of Tyre;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Assur also is joined with them: they have holpen the children of Lot. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 83:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 83,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Do unto them as unto the Midianites; as to Sisera, as to Jabin, at the brook of Kison:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "Judg. 4:15."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 20
          },
          {
            "start": 40,
            "end": 42
          },
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 56
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Judg. 4:15.",
            "prettyString": "Judges 4:15",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "judges",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 4,
                    "end": 4,
                    "verses": [
                      {
